    <body n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0412.diamartanon.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc">
      <div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0412.diamartanon.meineke1841-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0412_diamartanon">
        <head>ΔΙΑΜΑΡΤΑΝΩΝ</head>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-1">
          <head>I.</head>
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-1-l1">Ὅτε μειράκιον ἦν, τοὺς ἀώρους ἠλέουν,</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-1-l2">νυνὶ δ᾽ ὅταν γέροντος ἐκφορὰν ἴδω,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-1-l3">κλάω· πρὸς ἐμὲ γάρ ἐστι τοῦτ᾽, ἐκεῖνο δ᾽ οὔ.</l>
          </lg>
          <note type="source">Stobaeus Flor. CXIX 14 cum lemmate Ἀπολλοδώρου ἐκ Διαμαρτάνοντος.</note>
          <note type="apparatus">Vs. 3 libri κλαίω. Tum legebatur τοῦτο κεῖν᾽ ὁδοῖ. Trinc. τοῖτὸ κεῖν᾽ ὁδοῦ. Tyrwhittus τοῦτο κεῖνο δ᾽ οὐ. Perfecit emendationem Dobraeus Aristoph. p. 108.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" ana="#compiled-citation-normalized" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-2">
          <head>II.</head>
          <note type="source">Antiatticista p. 101 1.</note>
          <quote>Καθίσω: καθεδοῦμαι. Ἀπολλόδωρος Διαμαρτανούσῃ.</quote>
          <note type="apparatus">V. Hist. crit. p. 466.</note>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="unnumbered" ana="#compiled-unnumbered-fragment" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-unnumbered">
          <lg>
            <l n="1" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-unnumbered-l1">Miserabar iuvenis acerba funera:</l>
            <l n="2" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-unnumbered-l2">at nunc quoties intueor exsequias senis,</l>
            <l n="3" xml:id="meineke-0412-diamartanon-unnumbered-l3">id lachrymo. nam mox eadem me spectat via.</l>
          </lg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
